1
00:00:03,089 --> 00:00:07,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下想要避免不必要的争斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:07,097 --> 00:00:11,268
<c.simplifiedchinese>你愿意让开
并告诉我观柳和惠的位置吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:12,775 --> 00:00:16,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>用你的逆刃刀来问他们俩的下落吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:17,785 --> 00:00:21,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>我用这把刀来回答</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:45,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:02:03,287 --> 00:02:05,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>那把刀的长度…</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:07,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>你只用一把胁差迎战吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:08,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>别小看人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:02:08,882 --> 00:02:10,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>小孩给我退下</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:02:10,928 --> 00:02:11,804
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:02:11,888 --> 00:02:14,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下也正有此意</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:02:15,687 --> 00:02:17,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 不是那个意思…</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:17,190 --> 00:02:20,819
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个两个都…</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:20,906 --> 00:02:24,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>听好了 别一把胁差就把你打败了</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:24,746 --> 00:02:26,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>速战速决吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:29,047 --> 00:02:33,552
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果那真是一把胁差
的确可以轻松解决 不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:34,224 --> 00:02:37,227
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来你很了解小太刀的特性</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:37,857 --> 00:02:38,899
<c.simplifiedchinese>小太刀？</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:38,984 --> 00:02:43,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>简单来说
是一种长度介于长刀和胁差之间的刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:43,952 --> 00:02:46,955
<c.simplifiedchinese>小太刀长度更短 攻击力弱于长刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:47,042 --> 00:02:49,044
<c.simplifiedchinese>但重量更轻更加灵活</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:49,129 --> 00:02:51,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>防御力非常高</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:51,592 --> 00:02:55,512
<c.simplifiedchinese>与小太刀对决会非常不利</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:57,228 --> 00:02:58,354
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:58,439 --> 00:03:00,316
<c.simplifiedchinese>我先出招了</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:02,947
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:05,745 --> 00:03:07,497
<c.simplifiedchinese>-剑心！
-踢腿？</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:07,582 --> 00:03:08,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:09,044 --> 00:03:11,505
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟般若一样 是拳法家</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:22,905 --> 00:03:24,198
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:24,282 --> 00:03:26,576
<c.simplifiedchinese>用小太刀建立严密的防守</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:26,662 --> 00:03:30,249
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后用和般若一样的拳法展开攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:30,336 --> 00:03:33,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>教般若拳法的是我</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:36,807 --> 00:03:40,227
<c.simplifiedchinese>师徒出招的速度和力量完全不同</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:41,817 --> 00:03:43,360
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:43,446 --> 00:03:45,656
<c.simplifiedchinese>我对你没有私怨</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:45,741 --> 00:03:48,953
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你是最的维新志士 必须死在这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:50,543 --> 00:03:56,257
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来你们与我战斗不是为了观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:56,346 --> 00:03:57,222
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:58,434 --> 00:04:01,937
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是为了被推翻的德川幕府吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:04,029 --> 00:04:06,573
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然你是维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:06,658 --> 00:04:08,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>应该也了解鸟羽伏见之战</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:08,955 --> 00:04:11,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及德川庆喜的所作所为</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:12,629 --> 00:04:15,465
<c.simplifiedchinese>德川幕府最后一位将军德川庆喜</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:15,551 --> 00:04:18,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>得知他的军队占劣势</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:18,098 --> 00:04:22,061
<c.simplifiedchinese>只带着重臣逃出大阪城</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:22,148 --> 00:04:24,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>乘军舰逃到江户</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:24,653 --> 00:04:27,280
<c.simplifiedchinese>上万的将士们在战场上血染黄沙</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:27,367 --> 00:04:30,286
<c.simplifiedchinese>却被他抛弃了</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:31,208 --> 00:04:33,085
<c.simplifiedchinese>逃到江户后</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:33,170 --> 00:04:36,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>他自己避入上野的宽永寺
选择了绝对恭顺</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:36,802 --> 00:04:41,348
<c.simplifiedchinese>全权委托胜海舟与西乡隆盛谈判</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:41,436 --> 00:04:44,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>最终江户城无血开城</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:45,528 --> 00:04:50,408
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众还没投身战斗
幕末时代就结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:52,125 --> 00:04:54,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>德川那个懦夫怎样我不在乎</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:55,464 --> 00:04:58,801
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们对没能参与战斗深感遗憾</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:59,556 --> 00:05:02,100
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然历史上不存在“如果”</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:02,186 --> 00:05:04,439
<c.simplifiedchinese>但如果那时我们参与了江户的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:05,443 --> 00:05:08,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>最终的胜利将会属于我们幕府</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:13,083 --> 00:05:15,002
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们会在江户城放一场大火</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:15,087 --> 00:05:18,799
<c.simplifiedchinese>趁混乱之际 御庭番众出手</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:18,886 --> 00:05:21,221
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀死负责重要位置的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:21,892 --> 00:05:24,561
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样一来 剩下的乌合之众</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:24,648 --> 00:05:28,360
<c.simplifiedchinese>会被数量上占优势的幕府军一举击败</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:29,073 --> 00:05:30,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样就结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:31,828 --> 00:05:34,373
<c.simplifiedchinese>那种事怎么可能做得到！</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:34,459 --> 00:05:35,960
<c.simplifiedchinese>做得到</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:36,045 --> 00:05:38,381
<c.simplifiedchinese>不信的话 我把计划再现给你看</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:39,177 --> 00:05:40,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>在这东京</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:41,598 --> 00:05:42,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:43,685 --> 00:05:47,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过现在做这些都没有什么意义了</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:50,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>重要的是我要证明</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:51,535 --> 00:05:54,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>证明幕末最强的称号</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:54,958 --> 00:05:57,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>应该属于御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:01,053 --> 00:06:01,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>在幕末</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:02,849 --> 00:06:06,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论是维新志士还是幕府武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:06,898 --> 00:06:08,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>许多人在战场上献出了生命</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:09,446 --> 00:06:11,114
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然互为敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:11,199 --> 00:06:15,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>却没有对错之分</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是为了国家的未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:18,755 --> 00:06:22,759
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了人民的安稳幸福拼上性命</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:23,557 --> 00:06:25,434
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你不是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:28,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>你竟一脸平静地说要烧光一座城市</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:28,442 --> 00:06:32,029
<c.simplifiedchinese>沾满鲜血的只有一颗冰冷的好斗之心</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:32,783 --> 00:06:35,119
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论作为维新志士还是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:35,915 --> 00:06:38,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下都无法对你的行为坐视不理！</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:40,840
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论你说什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:41,384 --> 00:06:44,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算认真起来也没有机会赢我</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:44,516 --> 00:06:45,391
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:52,490 --> 00:06:55,284
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论是飞天御剑流的龙槌闪</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:55,371 --> 00:06:57,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是空中拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:57,667 --> 00:06:59,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>不错的攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:59,462 --> 00:07:03,007
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我的小太刀可没那么容易折断</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:05,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>可恶！</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:06,309 --> 00:07:07,727
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫那混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:07,812 --> 00:07:11,023
<c.simplifiedchinese>被我雇来还敢忤逆我</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:11,820 --> 00:07:15,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠和苍紫 两个都是混蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:15,578 --> 00:07:18,080
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:18,165 --> 00:07:22,628
<c.simplifiedchinese>和拔刀斋一样 那家伙对钱没兴趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:22,717 --> 00:07:26,512
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么时候与我为敌也不奇怪
实在太危险了</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:30,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋和苍紫
有没有同时除掉他们俩的办法？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:30,941 --> 00:07:32,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>想一想 观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:32,235 --> 00:07:34,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>动动脑子 想想办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:34,616 --> 00:07:36,993
<c.simplifiedchinese>仔细想…</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:37,580 --> 00:07:39,457
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个 观柳先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:39,542 --> 00:07:42,170
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个测试定在今天 您准备怎么做？</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:42,255 --> 00:07:43,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:49,186 --> 00:07:51,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>攻击多少次都没用的</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:51,190 --> 00:07:56,153
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的小太刀甚至能挡住来福枪的子弹</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:57,578 --> 00:08:01,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心竟然一次都没打到他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:01,753 --> 00:08:02,629
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:02,713 --> 00:08:06,926
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论有多大的优势
他脸上都没有一丝笑容</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:07,013 --> 00:08:08,932
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是寒冰一般的好胜心</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:09,602 --> 00:08:12,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死 我的腿动不了了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:12,733 --> 00:08:14,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:14,111 --> 00:08:15,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:16,365 --> 00:08:19,743
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果这样就被打倒了
也太对不住惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:19,831 --> 00:08:21,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>也没脸回去见薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:24,796
<c.simplifiedchinese>想想阿左会怎么说我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:24,882 --> 00:08:29,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>更何况
我已经想到了小太刀的破解之 法</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:30,018 --> 00:08:32,895
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然我想说这是虚张声势</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:33,817 --> 00:08:36,862
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过以你的个性不会这么做</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:38,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我领教一下吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:39,369 --> 00:08:40,746
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的破解之法</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:42,626 --> 00:08:43,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>太慢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:43,795 --> 00:08:46,173
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？握着刀刃的根部…</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:50,224 --> 00:08:51,100
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:51,728 --> 00:08:53,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>你强大的秘密在于</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:53,565 --> 00:08:56,943
<c.simplifiedchinese>完美地控制对手的间合</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:58,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>间合…</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:59,284 --> 00:09:00,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>听好了 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:00,913 --> 00:09:06,085
<c.simplifiedchinese>间合就是在一个动作中
能够规范对手的攻击距离</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:06,758 --> 00:09:09,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>高手对决时</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:09,096 --> 00:09:12,099
<c.simplifiedchinese>控制对手的攻击距离非常关键</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:18,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>乍一看在下使用长刀似乎占优势</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:18,114 --> 00:09:21,992
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是更长的间合也创造了死角</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:25,584
<c.simplifiedchinese>你利用这些死角不断进攻</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:25,671 --> 00:09:28,966
<c.simplifiedchinese>当我把间合缩小到和小太刀一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:29,052 --> 00:09:31,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>死角就自然消失了</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:31,599 --> 00:09:32,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:32,726 --> 00:09:35,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且握着护手前的刀刃根部</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:35,273 --> 00:09:40,278
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是最钝的部分 不至于伤及筋骨</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:40,868 --> 00:09:43,078
<c.simplifiedchinese>皮开骨裂吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:43,957 --> 00:09:47,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>我见识到了刽子手的精髓</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:48,382 --> 00:09:54,138
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为回礼
我会用御庭番众首领的精髓打败你</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:56,900 --> 00:09:59,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么这么慢？这是什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:05,959 --> 00:10:08,879
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…剑舞？</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:09,507 --> 00:10:11,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟仪式性的剑舞不同</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:15,311 --> 00:10:16,562
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:16,648 --> 00:10:20,860
<c.simplifiedchinese>你太拘泥于动静分明的剑术套路</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:20,948 --> 00:10:24,451
<c.simplifiedchinese>无法捕捉到这种缓急自在的流水动作</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:25,039 --> 00:10:29,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是融合了拳法动作
和小太刀招式的实战剑舞</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:29,715 --> 00:10:32,593
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是四乃森苍紫真正的本领</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:33,514 --> 00:10:34,431
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:39,276 --> 00:10:40,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:43,242 --> 00:10:44,785
<c.simplifiedchinese>回天剑舞</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:45,538 --> 00:10:49,208
<c.simplifiedchinese>能解决所有潜入江户城盗贼的招式</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:49,839 --> 00:10:50,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:54,472 --> 00:10:55,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了 小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:58,562
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋已死</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:00,109 --> 00:11:03,362
<c.simplifiedchinese>少废话 下一个对手是我</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:03,449 --> 00:11:07,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算同归于尽 我也要打败你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:09,044 --> 00:11:10,211
<c.simplifiedchinese>很有气魄</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:11,256 --> 00:11:14,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>在这杀了你 连我都有点惋惜</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:15,766 --> 00:11:21,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦是神谷活心流重要的后继者</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:21,610 --> 00:11:24,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>可不能死在这种地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:24,742 --> 00:11:29,830
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下也不能在这种地方死掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:30,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:31,923 --> 00:11:33,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>你难道是不死之身吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:33,509 --> 00:11:34,968
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么可能？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:38,227 --> 00:11:39,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>回天剑舞</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:40,231 --> 00:11:43,109
<c.simplifiedchinese>像切木头一样斩断了我的铁制刀鞘</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:43,905 --> 00:11:45,323
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:45,407 --> 00:11:47,910
<c.simplifiedchinese>迅速举起剑鞘削弱一半攻击威力</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:49,082 --> 00:11:50,667
<c.simplifiedchinese>了不起的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:50,751 --> 00:11:53,629
<c.simplifiedchinese>不愧被誉为最强</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:54,259 --> 00:11:57,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 我也从心底认同了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:58,767 --> 00:12:03,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 这个最强称号
将会是我们的囊中之物</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:03,485 --> 00:12:05,028
<c.simplifiedchinese>小心 剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:05,114 --> 00:12:06,824
<c.simplifiedchinese>他要用回天剑舞了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:06,909 --> 00:12:11,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过吧
你不可能捕捉到这流水般的动作</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:11,751 --> 00:12:14,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且你已经遍体鳞伤 行动迟缓了</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:15,050 --> 00:12:17,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了 绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:33,587 --> 00:12:35,964
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:37,136 --> 00:12:40,223
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流 龙咬闪</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:40,894 --> 00:12:45,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流中唯一的空手技</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:45,486 --> 00:12:50,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>你流水般的动作在下的确捕捉不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:50,329 --> 00:12:54,208
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过当你从回天剑舞转向攻击时</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:54,295 --> 00:12:56,381
<c.simplifiedchinese>那一瞬则另当别论</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:56,466 --> 00:13:01,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫 如果你那么想得到最强称号
拿去便是</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:01,559 --> 00:13:05,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>那种东西在下并不留恋</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:05,276 --> 00:13:06,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在还有人</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:07,029 --> 00:13:10,366
<c.simplifiedchinese>等着在下去拯救 等在下回家</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:10,452 --> 00:13:13,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>她们要重要千万倍！</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:27,403 --> 00:13:30,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…要输了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:30,367 --> 00:13:32,619
<c.simplifiedchinese>别逞强 收手吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:32,705 --> 00:13:34,832
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论多么厉害 喉咙受到两次攻击…</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:34,917 --> 00:13:36,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>还没结束！</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:38,383 --> 00:13:39,718
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:39,802 --> 00:13:41,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:42,641 --> 00:13:43,893
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起这个 苍紫他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:44,812 --> 00:13:47,315
<c.simplifiedchinese>他死了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:47,401 --> 00:13:50,071
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 只是昏过去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:50,157 --> 00:13:53,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>不顾喉咙受到的两下重击</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:57,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>马上发出必须静止呼吸的最后一击</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:58,382 --> 00:14:01,885
<c.simplifiedchinese>必然会引起强烈的疼痛和呼吸困难</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:03,058 --> 00:14:06,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>结果他不肯认输的好战心</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:06,564 --> 00:14:10,402
<c.simplifiedchinese>招致了这样的结局</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:14,330 --> 00:14:16,207
<c.simplifiedchinese>被回天剑舞打倒时</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:16,292 --> 00:14:19,796
<c.simplifiedchinese>你那番勇敢发言让在下信心大增</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:22,722 --> 00:14:24,223
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:24,308 --> 00:14:28,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来就打败观柳 救出惠！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:29,694 --> 00:14:31,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是了不起的回复力</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:32,908 --> 00:14:34,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>我失去知觉了吗…</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:35,037 --> 00:14:38,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就不到十秒吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:40,630
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么不杀了我？</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:40,716 --> 00:14:42,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下现在是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:42,636 --> 00:14:44,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是刽子手了</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:44,515 --> 00:14:47,185
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过即使没有了结你</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:47,271 --> 00:14:51,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>以你的智慧也明白究竟谁胜谁负</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:53,658 --> 00:14:55,869
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫 回答我一件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:56,498 --> 00:14:58,416
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然在暗中进行任务</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:58,502 --> 00:15:01,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你担任御庭番众的首领这样的要职</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:02,635 --> 00:15:03,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>在维新这个时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:03,804 --> 00:15:06,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>总有一、两个机会聘请你做士官吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:07,394 --> 00:15:10,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果想施展能力</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:10,984 --> 00:15:13,403
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定还有其他地方可以施展</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:14,992 --> 00:15:17,537
<c.simplifiedchinese>的确有不少人想聘请我做士官</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:18,333 --> 00:15:19,668
<c.simplifiedchinese>上至加入陆军情报部</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:19,752 --> 00:15:23,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>下至政府要员的保镖
各种职位应有尽有</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:26,764
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这些职位只提供给我一个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:28,270 --> 00:15:32,315
<c.simplifiedchinese>火男和恶见这种只精通某种技能的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:32,403 --> 00:15:35,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉这种倒戈过的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:35,450 --> 00:15:38,412
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你看过般若的脸你就会明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:39,124 --> 00:15:44,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>其他的御庭番众成员
没有得到任何做士官的机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:45,554 --> 00:15:50,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>首领抛弃下属去政府担任职位
我怎么做得到？</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:51,858 --> 00:15:56,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不愿意做出像德川庆喜那样的背叛</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:57,076 --> 00:15:58,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>德川庆喜…</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:16:00,584 --> 00:16:03,837
<c.simplifiedchinese>他所实行的绝对恭顺</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:03,924 --> 00:16:07,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>是为了避免战争持续削弱国力
高度的政治判断</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:07,096 --> 00:16:10,725
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我依然做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:14,737 --> 00:16:16,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>我带领着御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:16,950 --> 00:16:19,869
<c.simplifiedchinese>被丢到明治的新首都东京后
已经过了十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:20,749 --> 00:16:23,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>我目送着他们一个个开启新的生活</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:25,674
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后剩下的部下只有四个</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:27,304 --> 00:16:32,643
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是除了战斗外一无所长的可怜人</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:33,817 --> 00:16:39,239
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此我想至少让他们得到最强的称号</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:39,328 --> 00:16:41,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>为御庭番众增添荣誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:44,129 --> 00:16:45,797
<c.simplifiedchinese>了结我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:45,882 --> 00:16:50,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则今后我会一直追杀你</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:53,940 --> 00:16:57,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>真丢人啊 四乃森苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:57,531 --> 00:16:58,949
<c.simplifiedchinese>哈喽</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:59,034 --> 00:17:02,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们的对话太长了
我实在忍不住打断</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:02,248 --> 00:17:03,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳…</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:04,044 --> 00:17:06,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好不用费力气找你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:06,256 --> 00:17:08,884
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真是自信啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:08,970 --> 00:17:13,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过看到这个
你还能保持这份自信吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:14,940 --> 00:17:16,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>-这是…
-难道是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:17,821 --> 00:17:19,156
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林机枪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,617
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:20,702 --> 00:17:22,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>1861年美国医生加特林发明的</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:22,456 --> 00:17:26,376
<c.simplifiedchinese>在美国南北战争中</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:26,464 --> 00:17:29,342
<c.simplifiedchinese>让北军大获全胜的最强武器</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:29,428 --> 00:17:32,014
<c.simplifiedchinese>日本的越后长冈藩购入了它</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:33,935
<c.simplifiedchinese>在戊辰战争第三战役北越战争中</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:37,982
<c.simplifiedchinese>它成为了政府军的最大威胁</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:38,070 --> 00:17:42,324
<c.simplifiedchinese>拥有改变历史的破坏力
和能创造新时代的高性能</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:17:42,412 --> 00:17:44,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>好好尝尝它的滋味吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:47,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林射击！</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:17:50,929 --> 00:17:51,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:53,726 --> 00:17:54,936
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:55,856 --> 00:17:59,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>吵死了 什么声音？</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:59,237 --> 00:18:02,240
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来楼上发生了什么异变</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:02,326 --> 00:18:03,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:05,206
<c.simplifiedchinese>放松点</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:06,084 --> 00:18:09,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉和我已经输掉了战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:09,633 --> 00:18:14,221
<c.simplifiedchinese>没兴趣趁着对手熟睡时偷袭
成为卑鄙的赢家</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:14,810 --> 00:18:18,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>我更担心的是苍紫大人</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:18,317 --> 00:18:21,111
<c.simplifiedchinese>我和式尉要上楼 你呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:21,198 --> 00:18:24,910
<c.simplifiedchinese>你人还挺好</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:24,997 --> 00:18:27,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只听见有人在讽刺我</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:18:28,546 --> 00:18:29,714
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:18:29,798 --> 00:18:31,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>醒醒 式尉</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:18:35,226 --> 00:18:37,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么啊？是般若</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:37,313 --> 00:18:40,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>睁开眼就看见你这张脸
真是提神醒脑啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:40,528 --> 00:18:42,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的 全都这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:44,244 --> 00:18:45,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 小矮个</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:45,622 --> 00:18:46,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>干什么 肥猪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:47,458 --> 00:18:49,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才的动静你听到了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:49,504 --> 00:18:53,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这肥猪也听到了 那我没有听错</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:54,723 --> 00:18:57,726
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来现在不是睡觉的时候</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:19:00,401 --> 00:19:02,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？厉害吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:03,407 --> 00:19:07,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>一分钟可以发射二百发子弹哟！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:07,749 --> 00:19:12,170
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋 他故意射偏 就为了遛我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:12,258 --> 00:19:14,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特…</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:14,763 --> 00:19:17,391
<c.simplifiedchinese>停下来就要被我打中了哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:17,476 --> 00:19:19,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳 你怎么会有这种武器？</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:19:19,857 --> 00:19:22,443
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟敢不叫我观柳大人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:19:24,783 --> 00:19:26,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:19:26,244 --> 00:19:27,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:19:27,455 --> 00:19:29,540
<c.simplifiedchinese>差不多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:19:29,626 --> 00:19:32,463
<c.simplifiedchinese>抽根烟休息一下 我来回答你的疑问</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:34,594 --> 00:19:39,974
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的最终目的
是成为世界上最富有的商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:40,064 --> 00:19:42,358
<c.simplifiedchinese>“死亡商人”</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:42,944 --> 00:19:45,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是武器商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:46,827 --> 00:19:49,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>通过贩卖新型鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:49,415 --> 00:19:53,586
<c.simplifiedchinese>为加特林机枪筹集资金</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:19:53,674 --> 00:19:57,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是大商人武田观柳大人
与生俱来的使命</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:19:57,306 --> 00:19:59,892
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙竟然…</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:19:59,978 --> 00:20:05,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了赚钱不惜践踏别人的生命</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:20:07,159 --> 00:20:09,328
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:20:09,414 --> 00:20:12,333
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为了得到那超凡的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:20:12,420 --> 00:20:15,423
<c.simplifiedchinese>付出了多少年月和代价</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:20:15,509 --> 00:20:18,971
<c.simplifiedchinese>肯定不容易 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:20:19,559 --> 00:20:20,768
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:20:20,854 --> 00:20:24,399
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了钱想获得力量就易如反掌！</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:20:24,485 --> 00:20:27,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要一瞬间 不用付出任何代价！</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:27,491 --> 00:20:30,870
<c.simplifiedchinese>金钱才是真正实力的证明！</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:30,957 --> 00:20:35,378
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么御庭番众
什么传说中的刽子手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:35,466 --> 00:20:37,426
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才是真正的最强</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:37,511 --> 00:20:41,056
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有比钱更好的东西！</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:20:41,644 --> 00:20:44,022
<c.simplifiedchinese>我现在就证明给你们看</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:20:44,692 --> 00:20:46,194
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:20:46,822 --> 00:20:47,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:20:51,623 --> 00:20:52,707
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:20:52,792 --> 00:20:54,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是现在 跑起来 拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:20:57,676 --> 00:20:59,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪一个？瞄准哪一个？</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:02,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>先从没法动弹的苍紫开始</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:21:02,896 --> 00:21:04,648
<c.simplifiedchinese>休想！</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:21:04,732 --> 00:21:06,943
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特…</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:21:10,661 --> 00:21:11,578
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉！</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:22:46,811 --> 00:22:49,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《死斗的结局》</c.simplifiedchinese>

